ademy-id "q-1395" :question/problem "The vector $u$ has magnitude $8$, the vector $v$ has magnitude $2,$ the angle between $u$ and $v$ is ${100}^{∘}$ and $n$ is the unit vector that points in the direction of $u\\times v.$ Find $u\\times v$ in terms of $n.$ Round your final answer to one decimal place where appropriate." :question/worked-solution "We use the formula for the cross product and obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|u|\\cdot |v|\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\cdot n \\\\  & =8\\cdot 2\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{100}^{∘}\\cdot n \\\\  & =16\\cdot (0.984\\,80…)\\cdot n \\\\  & =(15.756\\,92…)\\cdot n \\\\  & ≈15.8n.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-1395/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "09aeb7f5-31e0-5b2d-9e2a-8eace54a6665"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-1395"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-127849/selection/ec0deee587a1375d7f2dcc0dfb7648b827757315b8158bcdf8fda30b51c0b770" :answer/id #uuid "d7a9c7df-1a65-5d53-b4ad-d63eaef1a402" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "41.9n" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127849/selection/39124becddd2345728358a2d2ad2a9928e7a30b6525d91fd6140743e1148bf16" :answer/id #uuid "1d5c2725-a4a8-5c7b-8a37-806efebeeea7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "43.7n" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127849/selection/59cf5456069fc2b1ade9eac516c8dcd12b0fbf5ced10cf366f2de001172e9156" :answer/id #uuid "dc4007af-e3a1-5e00-82bf-7d52bf732464" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "40.1n" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127849/selection/a8d7b719573c7802746e3fb870f81518b4f5a1684a120da13cd6447f833f82e9" :answer/id #uuid "582f376d-dfd6-557f-afb6-ae1a8e87de3b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "47.3n" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127849/selection/4fe3c2360969859a1552c2fe4a70a3b5408cb9e2f67e6f75ab081dee77f8bb97" :answer/id #uuid "9b2dbc93