ude $5,$ the vector $b$ has magnitude $2,$ and $a∥b.$ Find $a\\times b.$" :question/worked-solution "Suppose $a$ and $b$ are nonzero vectors. Then, $a\\times b=0$ if and only if $a∥b.$\n\nTherefore, $a\\times b=0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-146265/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "82f31c6e-f9df-5e0a-88a4-a8ccfca00258"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-146265"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-146315/selection/481a7ab29b4933171b94f28b14d0f5293c0dae733a7f8906794c105e8108ecdf" :answer/id #uuid "c1660ef6-8741-5966-b26d-72008145561f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}z" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-146315/selection/bcf3818b0032c79fdad782cb49b17958a0b60cd9f13e5a4c23658ebdfe52ca75" :answer/id #uuid "96c7d8ce-69ba-5464-8827-17c9ad42553d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4z" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-146315/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "fc8313c1-b7ab-55d5-b2a8-2e5543cda634" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-146315/selection/a11b8025e3d301376fcfa9694c5231eec6a340a7d374db983bfc295e77de76f2" :answer/id #uuid "ae892eef-2dd5-545a-9088-fe9fa543ccec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2z" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-146315/selection/19f0373fe65134adbd0818e19652e593611f0d74ac7f2c48c77a16c90cc1d4e1" :answer/id #uuid "3ded8472-fc48-51fe-bf2b-6aaccc7b407a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2z" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-146315/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ceda88e7-1ba2-53cc-b05f-ddef2c392765" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-146315/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-146315/selection/481a7ab29b4933171b94f28b14d0f5293c0dae733a7f8906794c105e8108ecdf" "q-146315/selection/bcf3818b0032c79fdad782cb49b17958a0b60cd9f13e5a4c23658ebdfe52ca75" "q-146315/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-146315/selection/a11b8025e3d301376fcfa9694c5231eec6a340a7d374db983bfc295e77de76f2" "q-146315/selection/19f0373fe65134adbd0818e19652e593611f0d74ac7f2c48c77a16c90cc1d4e1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-146315" :question/id #uuid "95994c1d-aad1-539b-89d6-72e8e47df0f1" :question/math-academy-id "q-146315" :question/problem "The vector $z$ has magnitude $2.$ What is $z\\times z?$" :question/worked-solution "Suppose $a$ and $b$ are nonzero vectors. Then, $a\\times b=0$ if and only if $a∥b.$\n\nNotice that any vector is parallel to itself. So, we have $z∥z.$\n\nTherefore, $z\\times z=0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-146315/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "82f31c6e-f9df-5e0a-88a4-a8ccfca00258"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-146315"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-279290/field-1/bdba9a3e431602dc95a215874c3c44900af5455f27c68284534a32488cca1ac0" :answer/id #uuid "4290b716-920b-569f-adfe-371ad319240d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2n" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-279290/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "ecd32614-5989-5e8d-8882-7411ba3951d1" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-279290/field-1/bdba9a3e431602dc95a215874c3c44900af5455f27c68284534a32488cca1ac0" :answer-field/choices ["q-279290/field-1/bdba9a3e431602dc95a215874c3c44900af5455f27c68284534a32488cca1ac0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-279290" :question/id #uuid "9dd60796-bafb-575a-a2e8-7433bc08aed6" :question/math-academy-id "q-279290" :question/problem "Given the vector $a$ has magnitude $8$, the vector $b$ has magnitude $2,$ the angle between $a$ and $b$ is ${172}^{∘}$ and $n$ is the unit vector that points in the direction of $a\\times b.$ Find $a\\times b$ in terms of $n.$ \n\nType $n$ to represent the vector $n$ and round your final answer to the **nearest integer** where appropriate.\n\n$a\\times b≈$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We use the formula for the cross product and obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|a|\\cdot |b|\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\cdot n \\\\  & =8\\cdot 2\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{172}^{∘}\\cdot n \\\\  & =16\\cdot (0.139\\,17…)\\cdot n \\\\  & =(2.226\\,76…)\\cdot n \\\\  & ≈2n.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-279290/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "09aeb7f5-31e0-5b2d-9e2a-8eace54a6665"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-279290"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
